2, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair came in at 40% of normal, and September to October came in at 43%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 33% of normal and May to June at 177%. Every one of the 7 grids had its driest year in 1954, at 51% to 55% of normal.</p>"}
